<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A2.T6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The efficiency of our proposed methods in ScanQA, ScanRefer and 3D ReasonSeg.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.T7" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A2.T7.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:447.2pt;height:78.1pt;vertical-align:-37.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-129.1pt,22.5pt) scale(0.634017466692452,0.634017466692452) ;">
<table id="A2.T7.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T7.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T7.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt">Task Name</th>
